			"notes": "## Tapestry Minecraft Modding Framework\n\nThis is an alpha release of the Tapestry framework.\n\n### Installation\n1. Download the `tapestry-*-shadow.jar` file.\n2. Place it in your Minecraft `mods` folder.\n3. Ensure you have the Fabric Loader and Fabric API installed for Minecraft 1.21.1.\n\n### Developer Assets\nThe `types.d.ts` file is provided for TypeScript mod development.\n\n### Requirements\nMinecraft: 1.21.11\nFabric API: 0.141.3+1.21.11\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/alizzycraft/tapestry/commits/v0.3.0-alpha"
		}
